OL,3,GNEWSASupplies disrupted after four
OL,4,Awater mains burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes and businesses on the outskirts
OL,7,Fof Southampton are facing disruption to
OL,8,Ftheir water supplies after four water
OL,9,Fmains burst.
OL,11,FSouthern Water said two of the bursts
OL,12,Fin the Eling and Totton areas had been
OL,13,Ffixed with work ongoing to repair the
OL,14,Fothers. It said bottled water had been
OL,15,Fsupplied to under 40 properties
OL,16,Fimpacted.
OL,18,FThe flooding and repair work in the
OL,19,Fsurrounding roads has also forced The
OL,20,FEling Tide Mill Experience - a visitor
OL,21,Fcentre, cafe and shop - to close along
OL,22,Fwith the toll bridge.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
