OL,3,GNEWSASupplies disrupted after four
OL,4,Awater mains burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe water firm said teams were keeping
OL,7,Fa close watch on the situation and were
OL,8,Fworking to keep supplies running with a
OL,9,Fbottled water station prepared and
OL,10,F"ready to open" if circumstances
OL,11,Fchange.
